e2560x1440_1.png", "id": "1437623151225920", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820141_1437623154559253_6957459600206667060_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jdZLLQAO_48Q7kNvwF4quCc&_nc_oc=AdrOVN80e9elAYt8Q9Yh9DrmyxLhWywIfjfdK34_UkV5Sg7s3A2N-tl07HrooWwKqNc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEgNZR5ZClZKnyEBiWrK_DvsCFd6PydrlmWgvaIK5MKaQ&oe=6A8ED93F"}, {"file_name": "SaloonSharpImage2560x1440_2.png", "id": "881789314314580", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827646_881789317647913_1810837243343415905_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QeSFsDk8QkQQ7kNvwFIjOWu&_nc_oc=AdoxGF3mM9A-mXQZnoSZb6He0AA-i3zlYNbb_2fr7Q7yrTcoEZHEYhBhySSSIMI6cMA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFKdTIMHTiXvD-Dw8CZM4zJr5aS3pb31IXyhi1yIsciZA&oe=6A8ED1BD"}, {"file_name": "SaloonSharpImage2560x1440_4.png", "id": "619492824542122", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823812_619492827875455_2534869941881102016_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BVduqRaAohIQ7kNvwFdEFop&_nc_oc=AdoJv9sZ00JPNhy4PNqN-AEoL8MPPMgPpSJ6KuTiFuDtmbmFCGiUct1zb2QxjLCnCss&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFAuSRoY7WuEZdTug5Y3AwpYOqh0EC6cbmRyl1kqHH-Ew&oe=6A8ED813"}, {"file_name": "SaloonSharpImage2560x1440_5.png", "id": "2116597272206324", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820141_2116597275539657_2379481800360106716_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=t3WCgScUWlAQ7kNvwGy79dz&_nc_oc=AdrA66JEMx_22TIm0oCCRDR5-D0XBFsy-sddPSL35RyrkRWcAmUPhoYcVVlS_XVEMJA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG7Y9OrjLv_rJMciiHHwFYf_Nt8nJUpkvtLNVJLPtvIqA&oe=6A8EF810"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "ThumbnailVideoTrailer2.png", "id": "1178572387619198", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821796_1178572390952531_3033249853253997231_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Mnge4SgDBwMQ7kNvwFWnjvG&_nc_oc=AdrJna3uqg2HODwTdg-hzgPO1VZgkNQL2Nth2OyCJd8s4LTn7xn16UmbDRhrfyQzdmU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGAyAYT8wY7De87flsNMfNkvtnPvYVZJ9EoiCEvarLYJQ&oe=6A8EC466"}, "display_name": "Wild West Panic", "keywords": ["arcade", "shooter", "cowboy", "casual"], "long_description": "Immerse yourself in the shoes of a famous **Far West cowboy**. No one is around, only wooden targets appear everywhere. It\u2019s up to you to shoot faster than your shadow!\n\n**Wild West Panic** is a hyper-casual game designed to introduce you to virtual reality. Explore the 7 levels and try to beat your high score !\n{1369934868174516}\n# Main Gameplay Elements :\n\n- **Environment & Level** : Experience seven closed environments that you can replay endlessly to beat your high score!\n\n- **Gameplay :** Jump straight into the action, no tutorial required.\n\n- **Game physics :** Enjoy partially destructible environments where you can practice and refine your shooting skills.\n\n- **Weapons :** Choose between one or two rifles for extra fun.\n{807953895607114}\n\n- **Enemies :** Face off against wooden target dummies that represent your enemies, turning the game into a true shooting range experience!\n\n- **Bosses :** Encounter surprising and entertaining bosses that vary depending on the level.\n\n- **Scoring :** Your score depends on both the number of targets you hit and your shooting accuracy, missing a target may cause you to lose bonus points.\n\n- **Replayability :** Play again to improve your score and try out different strategies!\n\n{1428852595510134}", "short_description": "Saddle up, cowboy! Step into Wild West Panic, the craziest VR shootout! Smash targets, rack up points, and prove you\u2019re the fastest gun alive ! A super-casual single-player game, engaging fun. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.vigo-crea